OL,3,GNEWSACharity beer mats offer men mental
OL,4,Ahealth support
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity has distributed 10,000 beer
OL,7,Fmats across pubs in a Staffordshire
OL,8,Ftown to offer help to men coping with
OL,9,Fmental health concerns.
OL,11,FMan Time, based in Stone, is led by
OL,12,Fparamedic Ian Goodship and offers
OL,13,Fsupport, with the mats provide
OL,14,Finformation about the group and other
OL,15,Fresources.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
