OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSACharity beer mats offer men mental
OL,4,Ahealth support
OL,5,
OL,6,FGoodship said he was spurred on to run
OL,7,Fthe club after suffering post-traumatic
OL,8,Fstress disorder (PTSD) and needing help
OL,9,Fhimself. His father Pete and friend
OL,10,FAllan Hall are also involved after
OL,11,Fthemselves suffering PTSD and
OL,12,Fdepression.
OL,14,F"I was a rufty-tufty paramedic... I was
OL,15,Fthe one sorting people's problems out
OL,16,Fand all of a sudden, it went 'crash',"
OL,17,Fhe said. Man Time now meets once a
OL,18,Fweek.
